  partName: Intake Manifold Stud (2)
  description: The Intake Manifold Stud (2) is a tiny, elongated component made of
    Material.001, positioned at the top-center-front of the engine, responsible for
    securing the intake manifold in place. Its small size and strategic location
    make it essential for maintaining intake system integrity and preventing air
    leaks. Interestingly, the Intake Manifold Stud (2) is designed with a fine thread
    to ensure a precise connection.
